    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_c_10",
      "hash64": "401F7B42B8B97C68",
      "text": "’Course, the whole book is full of unbelievable\\nstories, the Herba Mystica being one of them.\\r\\nBut they turned out to be real...\\c\\nAnd after everything we saw in Area Zero—well,\\nmakes it hard to say it’s all nonsense, huh?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
